# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 4 Expand the drama range of the horizon fire, the halo and glow of the sun near the horizon, and the pink belt of Venus opposite the sun (1.0 = natural, 0 = flat). Extend the length of the slow fade of the sky and earth after sunset (1 = natural, compressed to screen).
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1841
msgid ""
"Drama scales the horizon fire band, the sun's aureole and glow near the horizon, and the pink Belt of Venus opposite the sun (1.0 = natural, 0 = flat). Length stretches how slowly the sky and ground fade after sunset (1 = natural, compressed for the screen)."
msgstr ""
"توسع الدراما نطاق نار الأفق، وهالة وتوهج الشمس بالقرب من الأفق، وحزام فينوس الوردي المقابل للشمس (1.0 = طبيعي، 0 = مسطح). يمدد الطول مدى بطء تلاشي السماء والأرض بعد غروب الشمس (1 = طبيعي، مضغوط للشاشة)."

